    "id": "TALK_HUNTER_DOCTOR_INTRO",
    "type": "talk_topic",
    "dynamic_line": [
      "Normally I would tend to the wounded and do medical research, but with our relative safety and limited free time I mostly sell medical supplies these days.  I'm also the cook because nobody else here is good at cooking.  I would be surprised if one of them prepared an edible lung confit, let alone one that tastes good."
    ],
    "//": "The first two are relatively easy to produce and will be added to his trading inventory on seeing the notes.",
